Homepage: https://github.com/vinceliuice/WhiteSur-icon-theme

Package: claw-icons-whitesur
Architecture: all
Depends: hicolor-icon-theme
Description: macOS Big Sur style icon theme (WhiteSur) for claw-os
 Vendored copy of vinceliuice/WhiteSur-icon-theme. Installed under
 /usr/share/icons/WhiteSur{,-light,-dark}. cosmic-icons inherits from
 WhiteSur so folder, mime and action icons used by claw-os apps adopt
 the macOS look automatically.
